Change notice — 2026-11-17
Ridgeline Technology adapted QwikTape for Android as a local-only WebView app.
The port replaces Sciter, QuickJS BigDecimal, Sciter storage, and Sciter DOM
APIs with browser DOM/localStorage and decimal.js. It adds a pure JavaScript
tape engine, Android packaging, tests, and CI. No Sciter component is bundled.
The port bounds arithmetic results at 10,000 integer digits to prevent browser
formatting stalls, and invalid locale patterns reset to the default format
instead of retaining the previous locale as upstream does.
